<article class="env-lemma" id="03UC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03UC">Lemma <span data-tag="03UC">64.15.8</span>.</a> Let $P$ be an $A[\Gamma ]$-module, finite projective as $A[G]$-module. Let $M$ be a $\Lambda [\Gamma ]$-module, finite projective as a $\Lambda $-module. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \text{Tr}_{\Lambda }^{Z_\gamma }(\gamma , P \otimes _ A M) = \text{Tr}_ A^{Z_\gamma }(\gamma , P)\cdot \text{Tr}_\Lambda (\gamma , M).  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows directly from Lemma <a href="/tag/03UA" data-tag="03UA">64.15.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>